                <pb facs="d193-4" n="4" type="facsimile" xml:id="d193-4"/>
                <p rendition="#section-heading #italic">MINUTEMAN (ICBM) WEAPON SYSTEM</p>
                <p>The MINUTEMAN program is an Air Force development to provide a second generation
                    intercontinental ballistic missile using 3-stage solid propellant propulsion to
                    deliver thermonuclear warheads on targets up to 6500 nautical miles from launch
                    points.</p>
                <p>This project is now in advanced research and development and is approaching
                    component final design. The decision for production and deployment has not been
                    made.</p>
            </div>
